    "The monthly budget is used up. Bots pause new paid work until next month or until the budget is raised on the computer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The monthly budget is used up. Bots pause new paid work until next month or until the budget is raised on the computer."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le budget mensuel est épuisé. Les bots suspendent le nouveau travail payant jusqu'au mois prochain ou jusqu'à ce que le budget soit augmenté sur l'ordinateur."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O orçamento mensal acabou. Os bots pausam novos trabalhos pagos até o próximo mês ou até o orçamento ser aumentado no computador."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spending on paid engines this month, against the budget set on the computer.": {
      "localizations": {
