    "This permanently deletes the %@ group chat, its messages, and every thread in it, and turns off the routines that run there. The bots in it are not deleted. This cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This permanently deletes the %@ group chat, its messages, and every thread in it, and turns off the routines that run there. The bots in it are not deleted. This cannot be undone."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ceci supprime définitivement la conversation de groupe %@, ses messages et tous ses fils, et désactive les routines qui y tournent. Ses bots ne sont pas supprimés. Cette action est irréversible."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Isso exclui permanentemente a conversa em grupo %@, suas mensagens e todas as conversas dela, e desativa as rotinas que rodam ali. Os bots dela não são excluídos. Não dá para desfazer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
