            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nem todo bot pode usar estes apps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connecting an app here does not hand it to a bot. Each bot has its own Connected apps switch under Settings → Access, and until it is on the bot does not know the app exists.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connecting an app here does not hand it to a bot. Each bot has its own Connected apps switch under Settings → Access, and until it is on the bot does not know the app exists."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connecter une app ici ne la donne pas à un bot. Chaque bot a son propre interrupteur Apps connectées sous Réglages → Accès, et tant qu'il est désactivé, le bot ne sait pas que l'app existe."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conectar um app aqui não o entrega a um bot. Cada bot tem sua própria chave Apps conectados em Ajustes → Acesso e, enquanto ela estiver desligada, o bot não sabe que o app existe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
